#: ../../reference/gpu-atomics-operation.rst:12
msgid ""
":ref:`Atomic operations <atomic functions>` guarantee that the operation "
"is completed as an indivisible unit, preventing race conditions where "
"simultaneous access to the same memory location could lead to incorrect "
"or undefined behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/gpu-atomics-operation.rst:17
msgid ""
"This topic summarizes the support of atomic read-modify-write (atomicRMW)"
" operations on AMD GPUs. This includes gfx9, gfx10, gfx11, and gfx12 "
"targets and the following Instinct™ Series:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/gpu-atomics-operation.rst:23
